{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11301030","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11301030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1130103001:1":{"text":"お兄ちゃんたち、帰るまでにかかる時間がどんどん長くなってるの。きっと、もっともっと遠くまで食べ物を探しに行ってくれてるんだと思う。","source_cn":"姐姐和哥哥出去的时间越来越久，我猜他们是去到了更远的地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD6357ACC4A9A272","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130103002:1":{"text":"元々砂漠の果てには食べ物がほとんどなかったんだけど、私たちが食べる量も増えてきちゃって……","source_cn":"荒漠边缘的食物本就稀少，再加上我们吃的越来越多……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF70A820BB4FEA2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130103003:1":{"text":"ダメだ！ずっとお兄ちゃんたちに頼りっぱなしってわけにもいかないや。私も行動を起こさなきゃ！","source_cn":"不行！不能让哥哥姐姐一直为我们寻找食物。我也要行动起来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E83276EFE37D343","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小蛮血赞娜":{"text":"ババリアのザンナ","source":"小蛮血赞娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}